" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.4, Theorem 9.19 and search discussion, print pp. 404, 411–412; PDF pp. 426, 433–434; local computability corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 与规范确定机采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BVal}\">\\(\\operatorname{BVal}\\)</span> 对每个二进制词均有值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\n\\left[\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}(M,f)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\mathbf2}(I)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\;\\left(\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I,\\iota)\n\\land|\\iota|\\le\\operatorname{BVal}(f(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I)))\\right)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\n\\left[\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}(M,f)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\mathbf2}(I)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\;\\left(\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I,\\iota)\n\\land|\\iota|\\le\\operatorname{BVal}(f(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I)))\\right)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有这样的总算法，先计算有限上界，再枚举其以内的所有非空索引列表：找到解即接受，全部失败即拒绝；无效实例码先拒绝。它将判定 PCP，矛盾。上界可以很大，也不要求多项式，这个反证仍成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","status":"resolved","id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","s